      "type": "pm:Conceptualizing",
      "withinTradition": "pmt:Theravada"
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "en": "Where the claim was put forward, given as an identifier rather than as a bibliographic reference: an issue number, a draft designation. Deliberately not dcterms:source, because what is named here is not a work a reader can obtain and must never be counted as one."
